   "Element": "SQ",
   "PrimaryAttribute": "QID52",
   "SecondaryAttribute": "pref_intro",
   "TertiaryAttribute": null,
   "Payload": {
    "QuestionText": "<p>Imagine you had to make predictions for <b>30 defendants</b> with the help of the model. The task could come in four versions:</p><ul><li>Model prediction only</li><li>Model prediction + explanation chart</li><li>Model prediction + feedback after each case</li><li>Model prediction + explanation chart + feedback after each case</li></ul><p><i>Feedback</i> means that after each case you learn the actual outcome and whether your predictions and the model's prediction were correct.</p>",
    "DataExportTag": "pref_intro",
    "QuestionType": "DB",
    "Selector": "TB",
    "QuestionID": "QID52",
    "ChoiceOrder": [],
    "Validation": {
