  {
   "SurveyID": "SV_57SmXSpbIXf7miq",
   "Element": "SQ",
   "PrimaryAttribute": "QID64",
   "SecondaryAttribute": "Thank you! The defendant profiles in this study are real, anonymised cases from Broward County, F...",
   "TertiaryAttribute": null,
   "Payload": {
    "QuestionText": "<h3>Thank you!</h3><p>The defendant profiles in this study are real, anonymised cases from Broward County, Florida (USA), collected in 2013–2014. The predictions came from a simple statistical model that is correct in about 70% of cases. This study is only a pilot: no decisions about real people are made with it.</p><p>Please click the arrow to submit your answers.</p>",
