   "Element": "SQ",
   "PrimaryAttribute": "QID91",
   "SecondaryAttribute": "instr4_fb_2",
   "TertiaryAttribute": null,
   "Payload": {
    "QuestionText": "<p style=\"border:2px solid #111; padding:10px;\"><b>Feedback:</b> After each case, you will learn whether the person was really arrested again, and whether your first prediction, the AI model's prediction and your final prediction were right.</p>",
